Bayden,

I use the following;

SQL> SHOW TABLE(CONSTRAINT) table_name

Do this on all your tables.  From here you can see what the foreign keys
reference.

After you have worked this out, you can sketch an ERD fairly easily.

Simple yet effective,

Jeff

